            ]
          },
          "400040805": {
            "id": "400040805",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "魈",
            "text": "原来如此，那么就让这两位前去赴会吧。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040806"
            ]
          },
          "400040806": {
            "id": "400040806",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "魈",
            "text": "寄信之人可能对海灯节图谋不轨，似乎准备纵火焚城。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040807"
            ]
          },
          "400040807": {
            "id": "400040807",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "贝儿",
            "text": "如此甚好。你们也好，我们也好。只是…$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040808"
            ]
          },
          "400040808": {
            "id": "400040808",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "伶俐鬼",
            "text": "只是，他们两人和我们两人，未免体形相差太大了吧。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040809"
            ]
          },
          "400040809": {
            "id": "400040809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不用担心，乔装打扮之后就认不出来了。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040810"
            ]
          },
          "400040810": {
            "id": "400040810",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "贝儿",
            "text": "虽然我觉得哪里不对，但是既然有仙人撑腰，应该不要紧吧。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040811"
            ]
          },
          "400040811": {
            "id": "400040811",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "伶俐鬼",
            "text": "那…那璃月安危就托付两位了，我们盗宝团也不希望全城尽毁啊。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040812"
            ]
          },
          "400040812": {
            "id": "400040812",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "魈",
            "text": "既然如此，我们就这样讲定了。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400040813"
            ]
          },
          "400040813": {
            "id": "400040813",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "请等等…$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
